        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260326-as-war-of-choice-escalates-into-international-crisis-miller-says-trump-has-no-strategy-1",
        "orario": "19:45",
        "timestamp": 1774550745,
        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. As 'war of choice' escalates into international crisis, Miller says Trump has 'no strategy' Middle East Issued on: 26/03/2026 - 19:45 Modified: 26/03/2026 - 19:56 Genie Godula welcomes Aaron David Miller, former State Department Middle East negotiator, and Senior Fellow at the Carnegie Endowment for International Peace. According to Miller, Trump's war on Iran is evolving into systemic entrapment, in which regional dynamics involving Iran, Israel, and the US have escalated into an all-out international crisis. Miller argues that Iranians are ready for \"serious negotiation\", but doubts Trump's pathway to peace: \"I don't think you can do this in phone calls on the back of a cocktail napkin or indirectly negotiated vis-a-vis the Pakistanis or Turks.\" 'Tehran assumes war is behind them: Iran will not capitulate, Trump has it all wrong' 26/03/2026 Middle East US claims 'strong signs' for deal with Iran 26/03/2026 Middle East Oil, stock trading spikes before Trump's Iran remarks spark insider trading suspicions 25/03/2026 Middle East Georgia’s links to Iran: Ex-Defense Minister Khidasheli denounces Al-Mustafa University activities 25/03/2026 Europe 'Difficult to overemphasise how risky it would be for the US' to put boots on the ground: expert 25/03/2026 Middle East Israel 'concerned Trump could decide to end war unilaterally as soon as Saturday' 25/03/2026 Middle East Iran rejects US peace plan, issues its own demands 25/03/2026 Middle East Iran media casts doubt on US peace plan as strikes land across the Mideast 25/03/2026 Middle East Israel's defence network challenged by Iranian cluster ballistic missiles 25/03/2026 Middle East"
